    "updated_at": "2024-01-11T18:43:38Z",
    "body": "Based on https://searchfox.org/wubkat/commit/6e1c9b06a562ecfc8363f93f0eb36d9bcd8f2631 this seems like a 13yo bug.\r\n\r\nAs @rniwa pointed out to me not inheriting `contenteditable` across tree boundaries was a deliberate choice. These attributes should follow that. I suggest we add tests for `spellcheck` and get this fixed.",
