    "created_at": "2024-01-11T19:23:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-11T19:23:48Z",
    "body": "The use cases for some of these attributes (ex. `spellcheck`, `writingsuggestions`, `translate`) inheriting across shadow boundaries seem more compelling than for `contenteditable`, so I'm not sure if aligning with `contenteditable`'s behavior for all of them is the right choice.\r\n\r\nCould you also share more context into why the choice was made to disallow `contenteditable` from inheriting across shadow boundaries?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
